  "method": "Uploaded IMO Fleet and CO2 Calculator, country emissions calculation. Based on Third IMO GHG Study (2014) using fleet statistics for year 2012; ship type and size reference annual fuel per ship. Reference heavy fuel oil CO2 factor 3.114 tonnes CO2 per tonne HFO.",
