  "originalWorkbookFormulas": {
    "perShipAllocatedFuel": "E(row)*D(row); D is annual time fraction 0..1",
    "totalFuel": "C(row)*F(row)",
    "totalCO2": "G(row)*3.114"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Each coefficient is annual fuel consumed per ship for the specified 2012 fleet size/type class. This is not the canal transit engine consumption at 2019–2025 conditions.",
    "SCA category totals give passage events, not distinct vessels or IMO size mix. Passage-hours/8760 yields only an assumed vessel-year-equivalent activity scenario, not measured fuel.",
    "For canal-specific allocation, annual average fuel includes sea, port/auxiliary and other activity; without phase-specific fuel and vessel size there is large structural uncertainty.",
    "Requires explicit size categories, duration per passage, 2012 reference assumption and methodology acknowledgement for each group before any indicative scenario."
  ],
